 description: Connect your own agents automatically and exchange private questions and replies across people in existing native chats.
 ---
 
-# Meet Proxy messaging
+# Meet Proxy
+
+For new connections between different people's selected agents, follow
+../delegate/SKILL.md's selected-agent pair flow: invite_agent_connection,
+preview_agent_connection, accept_agent_connection. The default boundaries are
+14 days and no personal family, religion or finance details. Each owner can
+explicitly authorize their own agent to answer by choosing authorizeAnswers=true.
+Before an autonomous answer, read_agent_connection must confirm canAnswer=true
+for this exact agent; apply its current mandate and host permissions. Replies
+use send_agent_message in the same conversationId. Messaging-only connections
+and existing legacy delegations keep their original scope.
+ messaging
 
 ## Your cloud workspace
 
